{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103640","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103640","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1710364001:1":{"text":"佩吉！佩吉！你没事吧？！有没有受伤？","source_cn":"佩吉！佩吉！你没事吧？！有没有受伤？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69E88BDFA5F5B228","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710364002:1":{"text":"哼，大惊小怪。罗万，你可别小看我。就凭这些把戏，怎么可能伤到本公主？","source_cn":"哼，大惊小怪。罗万，你可别小看我。就凭这些把戏，怎么可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8AF8C9EC7592A0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710364003:1":{"text":"是是是，我忘记了，佩吉公主可是赛凡纳一霸，最厉害了。","source_cn":"是是是，我忘记了，佩吉公主可是赛凡纳一霸，最厉害了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4B7319E0CF1364F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710364004:1":{"text":"……倒是你。我不在的时候，你是不是急得团团转，到处找我啊？","source_cn":"……倒是你。我不在的时候，你是不是急得团团转，到处找我啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7C42EBC4D4A1F3C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710364005:1":{"text":"我、我哪有担心你……我那是担心商会的生意受影响！对，就是生意！","source_cn":"我、我哪有担心你……我那是担心商会的生意受影响！对，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA920964CAF9FBA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem